Package: imv
Version: @DEB_IMV_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://sr.ht/~exec64/imv/
Depends: libwayland0, libxkbcommon0, libpango-1.0-0, libcairo2, libglib2.0-0, libpng16-16, libturbojpeg0
Description: Command-line image viewer for Wayland
 imv is a fast, configurable image viewer. This build targets the Wayland
 backend (EGL/wl_shm) with libpng and libjpeg-turbo image support, pangocairo
 text overlay, and libgrapheme Unicode segmentation. Runs as a native Wayland
 client under the iosc compositor.
